  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xF6;d till organisationen Dos generaciones f&#xF6;r att bl a genomf&#xF6;ra utbildningsseminarier f&#xF6;r bl a domare och poliser i Managua  om&#xE5;rdet. Temat &#xE4;r hur dessa instanser b&#xF6;r behandla och bem&#xF6;ta fall som r&#xF6;r sexuella &#xF6;vergrepp mo barn.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the local NGO &quot;Dos generaciones&quot; to mainly realize training seminars for among others judges and police in the Managua area. The theme is how these institutions should treat cases concerning sexual violence on children and adolescents.</narrative>
  </description>
